      "id": "C01",
      "name": "Cosmopolitan",
      "source": "102241",
      "raw": "Cosmopolitan is a generic culture whose followers see whole of Nirn as a single communiry. Adherence to Cosmepoliran customs grants bonuses to Sneak, Mercantile, Speechcraft, Security, Unarmored, Mysticism, Personality, Speed (+5) and penalties to Heavy Armor, Spear, Armorer, Axe, Alchemy, Enchant, Strength, Willpower (-5) to those being faithful to their culture.",
