      "raw": "Magocracic is a generic culture whose followers see pursuing knowledge as a necessary part of life,\nAdherence to Magocratic customs grants bonuses to Illusion, Alchemy, Gnchane, Alteration, Destruction, Restoration, Intelligence (+5), Maximum Magicka (50%) and penalties to Heavy Armor, Medium Armor, Spear, Axe, Athletics, Marksman, Strength, Endurance (-5) to those being faithful to their culture.",
