      "id": "F01",
      "name": "Akatosh",
      "source": "102856",
      "raw": "Dragon God of Time ~ is the chief deity of the Nine Divines and one of two deicies found in every Tamrielic religion, He is generally considered to be the first of the Gods to form in the Beginning Place; after his establishment, other spirits found the process of being easier and the various panrheons of the world emerged. He is the ultimate God of the Cyrodilic Empire, where he embodies the qualiries of endurance, invincibilicy, and everlasting legitimacy.\nAkarosh (ts usually venerared by Cyrodiils and Bretons.\nBonus to Endurance (+10) is bestowed upon followers of Akarosh.",
