      "raw": "The Huntsman - is a Daedric Prince whose sphere is the Hunt, the Sporc of Daedra, the Grear Game, the Chase, During the Dawn Gra, before Y'ffre stabilized the forms of most creatures, life was stuck in a primal chaos, ever shapeshifting state called the Ooze, Some cultures, such as that of the Khajiir, credir Hircine as being responsible for this Shapelessness, and the Bosmer people believe that Hircine wishes to return to this state of chaos. Indeed, many of the curses he has unleashed on Tamriel share this theme, these therianchropic diseases which transform mortals into were-creacures, Whilst Nirn‘s inhabitanrs may see these creatures as nothing more than abominations, Hircine views them as his children, and is a guardian to them,\nAbility to Detect Animals is bescowed upon followers of Hircine.",
