      "raw": "God of Schemes ~ is the Daedric Prince whose sphere is the domination and enslavemenc of morcals, His main desire is to harvest the souls of mortals and to bring them within his sway by spreading seeds of strife and discord in the mortal realms. To this end, he obsessively collects a great number of soul gems, and has even dragged pieces of Nirn into his realm to satisfy his insatiable desire for conquest, The more souls he collects, the more he wanrs. Molag Bal values patience and cunning. He does not hesitate to deceive those he deals with, and is capable of waiting exceedingly long periods of time to carry out the schemes he prepares. He also takes great pleasure in the suffering of mortals, and often has them tortured for his amusemene. The Prince has a penchance for necromancy, often employing the use of the risen dead and forcing his followers to serve beyond the grave, He is incimarely familiar with death and is capable of preserving live mortals for excended periods of time to prolong their suffering.",
