      "effects": "Strength +5; Willpower +5; Endurance +5; Resist Magicka 25%; Intelligence -5; Agility -5; Personality -10",
      "notes": [],
      "raw": "These sophisticated barbarian beast peoples of the Wrothgarian and Dragonrail Mountains are noted for their unshakeable courage in war and their unflinching endurance of hardships. Orc warriors in heavy armor are among the finest front-line troops in the Empire. Most Imperial citizens regard Orc society as rough and cruel, but there is much to admire in their fierce tribal loyalties and generous equality of rank and respect among the sexes.\n\nAdmixture of Orsimer blood flowing in your veins grants you bonus to strength, willpower, endurance and resistance to non-elemental magicka at a cost of penalty to intelligence, agility and personality.\n\nGAMEPLAY EFFECTS: Strength +5; Willpower +5; Endurance +5; Resist Magicka 25%; Intelligence -5; Agility -5; Personality -10",
      "page": 65
